{"id":"n1-159","title":"Verbる ことのないように (Verb-ru koto no nai you ni)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the desire or effort to prevent something: 'so as not to...', 'to avoid...'.","longExplanation":"Verbる ことのないように is used to show that one is trying or intending to prevent some action from happening. It's like 'so that this doesn't happen' or 'in order not to...'.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + ことのないように","examples":[{"jp":"車をなくすことのないように、駐車場で必ずロックしましょう。","romaji":"Kuruma o nakusu koto no nai you ni, chuushajou de kanarazu rokku shimashou.","en":"Lock your car in the parking lot so you don't lose it.","words":[{"surface":"車","vocabId":"1323080","reading":"くるま"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なくす","vocabId":"2835808","reading":"なくす"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"よう","vocabId":"1546200","reading":"よう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"駐車","vocabId":"1426910","reading":"ちゅうしゃ"},{"surface":"場","vocabId":"1355790","reading":"ば"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"必ず","vocabId":"1487400","reading":"かならず"},{"surface":"ロック","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"風邪を引くことのないように、手をよく洗いましょう。","romaji":"Kaze o hiku koto no nai you ni, te o yoku araimashou.","en":"Wash your hands well so you don't catch a cold.","words":[{"surface":"風邪","vocabId":"1583720","reading":"かぜ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"引く","vocabId":"1169250","reading":"ひく"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"よう","vocabId":"1546200","reading":"よう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},